4. No confidential material
================================================================

This archive contains no hidden task materials, no private evaluation
records, no credentials and no third-party confidential data. Every
physical constant used by harness/cz_agent.py (device identifier,
qubit frequencies, gate flux) comes from the task's public
instruction; all other device values are measured at runtime through
the task's own MCP service.
